        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Meet Bhupinderjit Chana (@chefbhu), a Madhuban Performing Arts dancer, teacher, and creative visionary. Catch her in I, Sita at The GRAND on Sept 27 - a bold retelling of the Ramayana through dance, culture, and storytelling."
